message: "If you use Project Construct, please cite it using the metadata from preferred-citation in this file. Teaching text, explanations, and figures are CC BY 4.0. Source code is MIT (see LICENSE-CODE)."
type: software
title: "Project Construct: A hands-on library for mathematical and computational psychology and neuroscience"
abstract: "A hands-on library for mathematical and computational psychology and neuroscience. Lessons start with the basic mathematics and move on to their applications in computational modelling. Each lesson opens as a Jupyter notebook that runs in the browser. Teaching text, explanations, and figures are CC BY 4.0. Source code is MIT."
